# 40-Testing: Quality Assurance

Ensure all changes are verified and adhere to testing policies.

## Testing Documentation
- [Testing Policy](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.policies/testing-policy.md): Mandatory testing requirements.
- [Testing Standards Workflow](file:///Users/antonio.ventilii/projects/icdc-core/.workflows/testing-standards.md): Process for verifying changes.

## Requirements
- **Verification Plan**: Every implementation plan must include a section on how changes will be verified.
- **Unit Tests**: Mandatory for all new logic.
- **Integration Tests**: Required for cross-canister or complex state transitions.
- **Quality Checks**: Ensure `npm run quality` passes before completion.
